What this fork adds (MIT)
-------------------------
- Long-term memory — the character keeps a small, curated memory file per
  character, injected every turn and rewritten in the background after each
  exchange: src/open_llm_vtuber/memory_core.py, memory_route.py,
  MEMORY_SYSTEM_DESIGN.md
- Proactive conversation — she opens up on her own when the room goes quiet,
  optionally riffing on today's headlines: news_topics.py, topics_route.py,
  proactive_context.py
- Sleep mode — say goodnight and she stops initiating until you speak again:
  sleep_mode.py
- Group conversation — two characters talking to each other:
  conversations/group_conversation.py
- Stage performances — camera/lighting presets the character can trigger from
  the conversation: stage_director.py
- In-app settings for everything above, so nothing requires hand-editing YAML:
  api_guard.py (access control), conf_editor.py (comment-preserving config
  edits), and the settings routes (character, persona, llm_config, memory,
  perf, translator, player, network, voice, live2d_config, topics)
- Natural barge-in and VAD tuning

